# TkanMarket – Cursor Rules
# This file is automatically read by Cursor AI

## Stack
Next.js 16 App Router · TypeScript 5 strict · Tailwind CSS · Shadcn/UI · TanStack Query 5
Drizzle ORM · PostgreSQL 16 · BullMQ · Redis 7 · Playwright · OpenAI API

## CRITICAL: Database Primary Keys
EVERY table: integer('id').generatedAlwaysAsIdentity().primaryKey()
NEVER UUID as PK. NEVER BIGSERIAL.

## CRITICAL: Every Table Needs
created_at, updated_at (timestamptz, defaultNow())
deleted_at (timestamptz, nullable) – soft delete always

## CRITICAL: No business logic in API routes – services only
## CRITICAL: All inputs validated with Zod
## CRITICAL: Named exports everywhere except page.tsx
## CRITICAL: No any type – use unknown and narrow
## CRITICAL: Mobile-first Tailwind only (no CSS modules)
## CRITICAL: next/image for all images with explicit dimensions
